#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0640 expect=violation domain=ADAE
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when SDTM SUPPAE contains a record with QNAM=AETRTEM for a subject but AETRTEM is not a column of the corresponding ADVERSE EVENT sub-class OCCDS (ADaM) dataset.
#note "PLAN-split-supp-resolution (C35): SUPPAE is submitted split as SUPPAE1 + SUPPAE2 (RDOMAIN=AE, no SUPPAE); AETRTEM is delivered ONLY by SUPPAE2. The qualified requirement AE.AETRTEM is met through the family's SUPP sources (SuppQualifiers, the one chooser) and ADAE lacks the column -> violation. Red on the pre-plan engine: only an exactly-named SUPPAE was consulted, the requirement was unmet and the rule SKIPped."
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ASEQ type=Num
col AETERM type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | HEADACHE
---

dataset AE label="Adverse Events"
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AESEQ type=Num
col AETERM type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | HEADACHE
---

dataset SUPPAE1 label="Supplemental Qualifiers for AE (part 1)"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col RDOMAIN  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col IDVAR    type=Char
col IDVARVAL type=Char
col QNAM     type=Char
col QLABEL   type=Char
col QVAL     type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | AE | 01-701-1015 | AESEQ | 1 | AESOSP | Other Medically Important SAE | N
---

dataset SUPPAE2 label="Supplemental Qualifiers for AE (part 2)"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col RDOMAIN  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col IDVAR    type=Char
col IDVARVAL type=Char
col QNAM     type=Char
col QLABEL   type=Char
col QVAL     type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | AE | 01-701-1015 | AESEQ | 1 | AETRTEM | Treatment Emergent Flag | Y
---
